# PX4 v1.17 parameters derived for multi_drone_mujoco's rigid 27 g CF2X.
# Loaded by the project launcher through PX4_PARAM_<name>; this is not a PX4
# source-tree modification. Geometry uses PX4 FRD coordinates and Motor 1..4
# order FR, RL, FL, RR.
# KM signs include the FRD/FLU moment conversion used by this simulator; a
# real single-axis PX4 probe rejects the opposite (+,+,-,-) sign set.
